# Crowdsec commands

#-----

### manually install collections

```
docker exec  $(docker ps -q -f name=sksec_crowdsec | head -n1) cscli collections install crowdsecurity/traefik

```

### update hubs

```
docker exec  $(docker ps -q -f name=sksec_crowdsec | head -n1) cscli hub update

```

### add bouncer

(save api key somewhere)

```
docker exec  $(docker ps -q -f name=sksec_crowdsec | head -n1) cscli bouncers add bouncer-traefik

```

### ban ip

```
docker exec  $(docker ps -q -f name=sksec_crowdsec | head -n1) cscli decisions add --ip 203.0.113.10

```

### unban ip

```
docker exec  $(docker ps -q -f name=sksec_crowdsec | head -n1) cscli decisions delete --ip 203.0.113.10
```

### see metrics

```
docker exec  $(docker ps -q -f name=sksec_crowdsec | head -n1) cscli metrics

```

### see bans

```
docker exec  $(docker ps -q -f name=sksec_crowdsec | head -n1) cscli decisions list
```
